      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you are craving the relief of stopping the struggle, and the weight of carrying everything alone is incredibly heavy. Your desire for peace and the need to acknowledge the limits of what we can control are valid feelings, even if they feel like the end of our purpose. Please consider talking to a mental health professional who can help you navigate this profound burnout without prescribing anyone else's definition of what you must do. You do not have to figure this out alone, and seeking support never feels like a mistake.",
